B.Pl=new A.bn("Single-axis foot",B.ah,"Single-axis foot","Rapid achievement of foot flat enhances knee stability by quickly moving the ground reaction force vector anterior to the knee joint. Ideal for K2 ambulator with transfemoral amputation.","Single-axis foot achieves foot flat faster than any other foot \u2014 creates rapid knee extension moment. Best for TF amputees needing knee stability.")
