B.Pn=new A.bn("Halo vest",B.ah,"Halo vest","When maximum multiplanar restriction is required in the lower C-spine, halo vest is the most effective external immobilizer.","Halo vest is the gold standard for maximum cervical restriction at any level. However, paradoxical motion (snaking) can occur at C1-C2 with lower C-spine halo use.")
B.Po=new A.bn("Activity-specific prosthesis",B.ah,"Activity-specific prosthesis","Dedicated sport prostheses (running blade, swimming foot, cycling foot) are optimized for the biomechanical demands of specific activities.","Running blades (e.g., Cheetah) are J-shaped carbon fiber designs that maximize energy return for sprinting. Not appropriate for walking.")
