B.PC=new A.bn("What is the patient's K-level?",B.Yg,null,null,null)
B.PD=new A.bn("Hybrid prosthesis",B.ah,"Hybrid prosthesis (body-powered elbow + myoelectric hand)","Most common transhumeral prosthetic setup. Body-powered elbow provides reliable elbow control and proprioceptive feedback while myoelectric hand offers superior grip function and cosmesis.","Hybrid = body-powered elbow + myoelectric TD. Most common TH setup. Combines cable proprioception at elbow with powered grip at hand.")
B.PE=new A.bn("SOMI brace",B.ah,"SOMI brace","Best single-plane flexion control of any cervical orthosis, restricting 93% of flexion. Sternal and mandibular plates provide anterior support.","SOMI = best flexion control. Remember: SOMI has NO posterior component \u2014 it is an anterior-only design with head band.")
B.PF=new A.bn("Floor Reaction Orthosis / GRAFO",B.ah,"Floor Reaction Orthosis (FRO) / Ground Reaction AFO (GRAFO)","Creates a knee extension moment by blocking dorsiflexion and redirecting the ground reaction force anterior to the knee. Requires adequate quadriceps to be effective.","FRO requires intact quads (\u22653+/5) to work. It creates a knee extension moment by blocking tibial progression.")
B.PG=new A.bn("Articulated AFO with PF stop",B.ah,"Articulated AFO with plantarflexion stop","Controls foot drop during swing phase while allowing free dorsiflexion during stance. The PF stop prevents foot slap at initial contact.","Articulated AFO with PF stop allows tibial progression over the foot in stance \u2014 critical for a more normal gait pattern.")
B.PH=new A.bn("High-performance ESAR or microprocessor ankle",B.ah,"High-performance ESAR foot or microprocessor ankle (BiOM/Empower)","Microprocessor ankles actively generate push-off power, reducing metabolic cost by up to 12% compared to passive ESAR feet. High-performance ESAR feet offer maximum energy return for active K4 users.","The BiOM/Empower is the only powered ankle \u2014 it generates active push-off, approaching biological ankle power output.")
B.PI=new A.bn("Full myoelectric with TMR",B.ah,"Full myoelectric prosthesis with targeted muscle reinnervation (TMR)","TMR surgery transfers residual arm nerves to chest muscles, creating new EMG sites for intuitive, simultaneous multi-joint control. Best cosmesis and most natural control.",'TMR: median, ulnar, radial, musculocutaneous nerves transferred to pectoralis/serratus. Enables intuitive "think and move" control + reduces phantom pain.')
B.PJ=new A.bn("Articulated AFO with PF AND DF stop",B.ah,"Articulated AFO with plantarflexion and dorsiflexion stop","Controls both foot drop and knee recurvatum. The DF stop prevents excessive tibial advancement that drives the knee into hyperextension.","DF stop set at 5\xb0 dorsiflexion prevents recurvatum by blocking further tibial progression.")
B.PK=new A.bn("Four-poster brace",B.ah,"Four-poster brace","Better extension control than SOMI due to bilateral posterior uprights connecting occipital and thoracic plates.","Four-poster provides better extension control than SOMI. Two anterior + two posterior uprights with mandibular and occipital supports.")
