B.Q5=new A.bn("Consider shoe modification or foot orthosis",B.ah,"Shoe modification or foot orthosis","If no foot drop, no crouch gait, and no ML instability, the dysfunction may be addressable with less restrictive interventions such as custom foot orthoses or shoe modifications.",null)
B.Q6=new A.bn("Solid AFO",B.ah,"Solid AFO","Controls all ankle motion and provides maximum stability. Because the solid AFO blocks plantarflexion at initial contact, the ground reaction force vector falls posterior to the knee, producing an external knee FLEXION moment at heel strike (not extension).","Solid AFO blocks both dorsiflexion and plantarflexion. By blocking plantarflexion at heel strike it creates a knee FLEXION moment \u2014 patients need adequate quadriceps to resist knee buckling in early stance.")
